WEBVTT
NOTE OpenIE Planetary 15s v1.0 — interface-economics (ig) · elevenlabs:eleven_v4_turbo

1
00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:10.176
<v Narrator>N'oge mbụ, nkwụsị nke otu n'ime ndị na-enyefe ihe na-eweta akara ọnụahịa ziri ezi, dị ka ịhapụ ọrụ Mars site na ịdị iche iche.

2
00:00:10.256 --> 00:00:20.634
<v Narrator>Nke abụọ, ndị mba ọzọ software-akwụsịla ọnụọgụgụ na-abịa site n'ọtụtụ nyocha na ụdị, ọ dịghị mgbe ejiri ha tụnyere handoffs naanị.

3
00:00:20.714 --> 00:00:30.690
<v Narrator>Nke atọ, ịlele ihe ọ bụla n'ime akụkụ ahụ na-atụ anya bụ ọnụ ala, mana otu otu na-akwụ ụgwọ mgbe ndị ọzọ niile na-enweta uru.
